WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.595
Watch and read: Ama asks: In a drama, Ama acts as a market seller. What should you do

00:00:05.595 --> 00:00:06.195
while watching?

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:12.025
The answer is: Listen and notice the actions. Watch characters and events carefully.

00:00:12.867 --> 00:00:18.584
Watch and read: Ama asks: Read: “First Ama found a lost pencil. Next Ama asked for

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:22.872
help. Finally Ama returned the pencil to the teacher.” What happened finally?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:28.322
The answer is: returned the pencil to the teacher. Look for the last event when

00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:29.247
retelling in order.
